## Logging workflow (when user sends screenshot + URL)

User does **not** need to click Done on site if agent handles logging.

**Git:** logging = always `git commit` + `git push origin main` immediately after updating `tracker-data.json`. No ask. Overrides general "commit only when asked" rule.

| When | User sends | Agent does |
|------|------------|------------|
| Right after post | screenshot + URL (+ «опублікував» optional) | Classify `type` + `traits` + `slot` + `bucket` → update `public/tracker-data.json` → **commit + push** |
| ~3h later | screenshot + URL | Update metrics (`views`, likes, replies); `ageHours` on snapshot = hours from post `at` to check time → commit + push |
| ~24h later | screenshot + URL | Update metrics; previous check-in saved in `snapshots` → commit + push |
| URL replace / metric refresh | screenshot + URL | Upsert by URL → commit + push |

- **Lead `type`** + optional **`fullTypes[]`** (dual norm when 2 types at 100%) + **`traits[]`** (combo only) + **`visualCluster`** (`scorecard` | `collage` | `chart` | `screenshot` | `meme` | `text-only`)
- **MoveMatch / product promo** → lead `type: builder` (squad screenshots, MD posts, QT @MoveMatchxyz for reach). Not strategic QT just because it's a quote tweet.
- Same tweet URL = update existing log, do not duplicate.
- Communicate analysis to user **in Ukrainian**. App UI stays English.
- User consults in chat before posting → agent already knows classification when they say «опублікував».

